The vocabulary and merge data in this directory (vocab.json, merges.txt,
special_tokens.txt) were extracted from the TabiBERT tokenizer released by
TABILAB at Boğaziçi University and are distributed under the Apache License
2.0.

Original repository:
    https://huggingface.co/boun-tabilab/TabiBERT

Paper:
    Melikşah Türker, Asude Ebrar Kızıloğlu, Onur Güngör, Susan Üsküdarlı
    (2026). "TabiBERT: A Large-Scale ModernBERT Foundation Model and A
    Unified Benchmark for Turkish." arXiv:2512.23065.

Full license text:
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
